@startuml
title Confirmed preset-save communication

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

object User
object "monitorTouchInput\n(touch coroutine)" as TouchTask
object "Queue<UiAction, 8>" as Queue
object "processUiActions\n(application coroutine)" as Application
object "UiActionProcessor" as Processor
object "ControllerModel" as Model
object "ControllerMessages" as Messages
object "persistStableManualColor\n(persistence coroutine)" as PersistenceTask
object "ColorPersistenceService" as Persistence
object "ESP32 Preferences / NVS" as Nvs
object "updateEffectUi\n(UI coroutine)" as UiTask
object "UiRenderer" as Renderer
object "PresetButtonControl" as Preset

User --> TouchTask : 1: hold preset for 700 ms
TouchTask --> Queue : 2: send(StorePreset)
Queue --> Application : 3: receive()
Application --> Processor : 4: process(StorePreset, now)
Processor --> Model : 4.1: copy selected color to preset
Processor --> Messages : 4.2: publish latest preset-save request
Messages --> PersistenceTask : 5: takePersistence()
PersistenceTask --> Persistence : 5.1: queuePresetSave(...)
PersistenceTask --> Persistence : 6: process(now, model)
Persistence --> Nvs : 6.1: putUInt(preset key)

Nvs --> Persistence : 7a: success
Persistence --> PersistenceTask : 7a.1: return saved preset bit
PersistenceTask --> Messages : 7a.2: notifyPresetSaved(index)
Messages --> UiTask : 7a.3: confirmed SAVED notification
UiTask --> Renderer : 7a.4: notify + redraw preset
Renderer --> Preset : 7a.5: show SAVED for bounded duration

Nvs --> Persistence : 7b: failure
Persistence --> PersistenceTask : 7b.1: retain pending value\nand schedule retry

note bottom of Persistence
  Failure logs a warning and never emits
  the success-shaped SAVED notification.
end note

note bottom of Messages
  Each preset slot retains its latest desired
  value until the persistence owner consumes it.
end note
@enduml
